function buildCadCraftDXF(){const lv=level(),lines=['0','SECTION','2','HEADER','9','$ACADVER','1','AC1009','0','ENDSEC','0','SECTION','2','ENTITIES'];const push=(type,pairs)=>{lines.push('0',type);for(const [code,v]of pairs)lines.push(String(code),String(v));};const seg=(x1,y1,x2,y2,layer)=>push('LINE',[[8,layer],[10,rnd(x1)],[20,rnd(-y1)],[30,0],[11,rnd(x2)],[21,rnd(-y2)],[31,0]]);const tw=state.project.terrain.w,td=state.project.terrain.d,org=origin();[[0,0,tw,0],[tw,0,tw,td],[tw,td,0,td],[0,td,0,0]].forEach(w=>seg(...w,'TERRENO'));
for(const w of allWalls(lv))seg(w.x1+org.x,w.y1+org.y,w.x2+org.x,w.y2+org.y,w.owners.length===1?'PAREDES_EXT':'PAREDES_INT');for(const r of lv.rooms){const n=r.name.normalize('NFD').replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,'');push('TEXT',[[8,'AMBIENTES'],[10,r.x+r.w/2+org.x],[20,-r.y-r.h/2-org.y],[30,0],[40,.23],[1,n.substring(0,50)]]);}for(const o of lv.openings){const hit=closestWall(o.x,o.y,allWalls(lv)),w=hit.wall;if(w){const len=wallLen(w),dx=(w.x2-w.x1)/len,dy=(w.y2-w.y1)/len;seg(o.x+org.x-o.width/2*dx,o.y+org.y-o.width/2*dy,o.x+org.x+o.width/2*dx,o.y+org.y+o.width/2*dy,o.kind==='door'?'PORTAS':'JANELAS');}}lines.push('0','ENDSEC','0','EOF');return lines.join('\n');}
function exportDXF(){makeDownload(buildCadCraftDXF(),filename('dxf'),'application/dxf');}
let cadReady=false,cadDirty=false,cadSent=false,cadLatest=null,cadTimer=null;
function sendCadProject(){const frame=el('cadcraftFrame');const bytes=new TextEncoder().encode(buildCadCraftDXF());frame.contentWindow.postMessage({type:'cadcraft:open',name:filename('dxf'),bytes:bytes.buffer},location.origin,[bytes.buffer]);cadSent=true;el('cadcraftStatus').textContent='Planta enviada: '+level().name+' · 1 unidade = 1 metro';}
function showCadCraft(){saveLocal();el('cadcraftPanel').classList.remove('hidden');if(cadSent){el('cadcraftFrame').focus();return;}if(cadReady){sendCadProject();return;}if(!el('cadcraftFrame').getAttribute('src'))el('cadcraftFrame').src='cadcraft/index.html?host=parent';clearTimeout(cadTimer);cadTimer=setTimeout(()=>{if(!cadReady)el('cadcraftStatus').textContent='O editor ainda está carregando. Se persistir, verifique suporte WebAssembly/WebGL e os arquivos da instalação.';},60000);}
window.addEventListener('message',e=>{if(e.origin!==location.origin||e.source!==el('cadcraftFrame')?.contentWindow)return;const d=e.data;if(!d||typeof d.type!=='string')return;if(d.type==='cadcraft:ready'){cadReady=true;clearTimeout(cadTimer);if(!cadSent)sendCadProject();}if(d.type==='cadcraft:dirty')cadDirty=!!d.dirty;if(d.type==='cadcraft:failed'){clearTimeout(cadTimer);el('cadcraftStatus').textContent='Falha ao iniciar CadCraft: '+String(d.error||'erro desconhecido').slice(0,240);}if(d.type==='cadcraft:save'&&(d.bytes instanceof ArrayBuffer||d.bytes instanceof Uint8Array)){cadLatest={bytes:d.bytes,name:String(d.name||'Projeto.dxf').replace(/[\/]/g,'_')};cadDirty=false;el('cadcraftCopy').disabled=false;el('cadcraftStatus').textContent='Arquivo recebido do CadCraft. Use “Baixar última versão CAD” para guardar sua cópia.';makeDownload(new Blob([d.bytes]),cadLatest.name,'application/octet-stream');}});
